            "description": "# Private Lecture Automation\n\nThis repository contains programs I use to make managing my private lectures easier.\n\nThese tools include:\n- `introduction_email` - upon request the script sends out an email containing the most up-to-date information about the lectures\n- `calendar_event` - automatically sends out the calendar event of the next lecture for each specific client\n\nFor detailed information about how the tools work take a look at the specific tool's folder.\n",
